@ColorComparisonApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Color Comparison - Compare 5 colors against scales
POST {{ColorComparisonApi_HostAddress}}/api/ColorComparison/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "colorHexCodes": [
    "#FFFF00",
    "#FFFF99",
    "#80DEEA",
    "#CE93D8",
    "#A5D6A7"
  ]
}

### Color Comparison - Invalid input (only 3 colors)
POST {{ColorComparisonApi_HostAddress}}/api/ColorComparison/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "colorHexCodes": [
    "#FFFF00",
    "#FFFF99",
    "#80DEEA"
  ]
}

### Color Comparison - Invalid hex code
POST {{ColorComparisonApi_HostAddress}}/api/ColorComparison/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "colorHexCodes": [
    "#FFFF00",
    "#GGGGGG",
    "#80DEEA",
    "#CE93D8",
    "#A5D6A7"
  ]
}
